# Financial Tracker

- Read `.agent/AGENTS.md` before coding. One feature from `.agent/feature_list.json` at a time.
- Prefer `docker compose up --build` (app :3000). Run `./init.sh` for local tooling verification; fix baseline failures first.
- Backend: FastAPI + **uv** + PEP 8 (Ruff). Frontend: SvelteKit.
- Scope all data by authenticated `user_id`. Money in integer cents CAD.
- Ontario HST rules for tax — no blind tax split across lines.
- Do not merge PRs unless the human asks. Do not invent a palette.
- UI PRs: Unslop + impeccable; `.agent/DESIGN.md` is the contract; tokens in `app.css`.
